From 2ceaea3f28bdffc9e7926cdcfb17b07a6cd8b607 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: JimmyBlunt <jo@paso-music.de>
Date: Mon, 5 Oct 2026 20:36:58 +1100
Subject: [PATCH 14/15] Active mask for installation maps: masked slots always
 black (local #9002)

The TouchDesigner installation maps (10,330 slots) contain 3,368 slots
without an LED position (TD active mask = 0), parked at one coordinate.
82 of them are routed to physical LEDs that must stay dark, but every
Pattern coloured them and the parked cluster skewed preview and FastLED
surface bounds.

- Storage: importMetadata.activeMask on the map record (existing
  import_metadata_json column, no migration, no API change: PATCH
  /api/maps/:id already writes importMetadata as a whole):
  { version: 1, encoding: 'rle01', count, first, runs, active, source?,
  fingerprint: 'fnv1a32:..', updatedAt? }. src/engine/maps/activeMask.ts
  encodes/decodes/validates it.
- MapImportMetadata is now a union: Controller imports (kind
  'controller') and installation metadata (kind 'installation', mask
  only). Frozen/read-only maps, the "Imported" facts and Controller
  stage-map matching check isControllerMapImport, so adding a mask never
  freezes an editable map.
- mapFromRecord validates the mask against the point count (wrong length
  or malformed: ignored, console warning, amber hint); resolveLayout
  exposes activeMask per pixel index plus the summary.
- createRenderLoop({ activeMask }): render functions still run for every
  index (Pattern state/determinism unchanged); masked indices are written
  black into the packed frame / pixel list, so preview and the router
  frame (externalPixelOutput) are black there and byte-identical
  elsewhere, for Pixelblaze and FastLED Patterns.
- Preview hands the renderer only the active indices (positions, normals,
  compacted frame copy): the parked cluster is not drawn and no longer
  affects measured bounds/spacing.
- FastLED surface projection: masked map pixels -> -1 and excluded from
  the fit bounds and the automatic 3D axis choice.
- Deck hint "Maske: 6.962 aktiv / 3.368 ausgeblendet"; map pane fact row.
- scripts/set-map-active-mask.mjs sets/clears a mask from a 0/1 JSON
  array through the local API (pxlblz_manager-style local dev session,
  merges existing metadata, refuses a length mismatch, verifies).
- Docs: CONTEXT.md "Active mask", Technical Reference.

Checks run manually (husky cannot run here): eslint src,
check:e2e-coverage, check:e2e-locators, tsc --noEmit, vitest node:
src/engine/maps (incl. new activeMask.test.ts), renderLoop,
src/engine/fastled, mapStore, showModel, importedMap, cloudflare/maps,
fastledProjectionStore (all pass); vitest jsdom: Preview, PreviewDeck
(new test passes; 2 pre-existing de-DE locale failures), MapContextPane
(1 pre-existing de-DE locale failure), ControllerProfilePage.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
